      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Mutfaklarda bulunan buzdolab\u0131, bula\u015F\u0131k makinesi, derin
    dondurucu gibi beyaz e\u015Fyalar a\u011F\u0131r y\xFCk ta\u015F\u0131yabilen
    e\u015Fyalard\u0131r. Bu sayede hayat \xFC\xE7geni olu\u015Fturabilir. Yaln\u0131zca
    mutfak dolaplar\u0131nda bulunan k\u0131r\u0131labilir bardak, tabak ya da d\xFC\u015Ft\xFC\u011F\xFCnde
    zarar verebilecek tencere, tava gibi e\u015Fyalar\u0131n kafaya d\xFC\u015Febilece\u011Fi
    unutulmamal\u0131d\u0131r."
